  Scimitar                 melee +4, reach 5 ft.
      damage: 1d6 + 2 slashing (avg 5); 1d4 slashing (avg 2) if the roll had Advantage
      P(hit) 50.00%   P(crit) 5.00%   E[damage] 2.925
  Shortbow                 ranged +4, range 80/320 ft.
      damage: 1d6 + 2 piercing (avg 5); 1d4 piercing (avg 2) if the roll had Advantage
      P(hit) 50.00%   P(crit) 5.00%   E[damage] 2.925
  Unarmed Strike           melee +1, reach 5 ft.
      damage: 0 bludgeoning (avg 0)
      P(hit) 35.00%   P(crit) 5.00%   E[damage] 0.000

Attack:
  1 x [Scimitar | Shortbow | Unarmed Strike]

Options:
  Dash (action)
  Disengage (action)
  Nimble Escape (Disengage) (bonus action; works as Disengage)

