Rule flags:
  expandedCritAutoHits=false [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.7 and p.179 tie the auto-hit to rolling a 20; p.49 Improved Critical only says it "can score a Critical Hit"; no Sage Advice entry]"
